# Add() should work if a symlink to a FIFO is already present. open() follows
# the link, and opening a FIFO for reading blocks until a writer shows up
# unless O_NONBLOCK is set, which hung Add() on macOS.
require symlink
require mkfifo

mkdir             /dir
mkfifo            /fifo
ln     -s /fifo   /dir/link
touch             /dir/file

watch /dir

touch /dir/after

Output:
	create  /dir/after
